# Never restart the server

Do **not** run `run.bat`, `stop.bat`, `run.py`, or otherwise start/stop/restart the
TraktTV Shows Tracker process on port 8300 (or any other port) unless the user
explicitly asks you to in that message.

If a fix needs a restart, say so and wait. Do not "helpfully" bounce the server
after deploys, schema changes, debugging, or clearing duplicate listeners.
